-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), נספח א': the work-week tables of a mother
-- teacher under the reform in full (§11 sends to it): for each age band, a
-- table under §11(א) (she cuts her hours) and one under §11(ב) (she keeps
-- the week she would have had); the 60-minute hour of their presence; their
-- note on frontal hours that are not whole.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-9`
IMPORT `oz-founding-annex-a1`
IMPORT `oz-founding-annex-a2`
IMPORT `oz-founding-annex-a3`

§ `נספח א'`

-- "מורה אם לפי סעיף ___ (א)" and its table: a mother under 50 who cuts her
-- hours under §11(א). The caption leaves the section's number blank; the
-- corpus marks the blank and reads it as §11, whose (א) and (ב) the
-- captions name. Each column is the position she would have had, her week
-- and the position she is paid on.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1/p1 akn:att_1__hc_1/p2 akn:att_1__hc_1/t1
`the (א) table of annex א' under 50` MEANS
    `Oz annexed table` WITH
        `the annex printing it`  IS "נספח א'"
        `the age band it is for` IS `the Oz band under 50`
        `what it is for`         IS `a mother cutting her hours, section 11(א)`
        `its columns`            IS LIST
            `an Oz annexed mother's column` (103.25%) (100.00%) 23 6 9.5 38.5,
            `an Oz annexed mother's column` (98.25%) (96.25%) 22 5.5 9 36.5,
            `an Oz annexed mother's column` (94.50%) (91.25%) 21 5 9 35,
            `an Oz annexed mother's column` (90.75%) (87.50%) 20 5 8.5 33.5,
            `an Oz annexed mother's column` (85.75%) (83.75%) 19 4.5 8 31.5

