-- A mother's two tables for each band.
GIVEN band IS AN `Oz annexed age band`
GIVETH AN `Oz mother's tables`
DECIDE `the mother's tables of annex א' for` band IS
    CONSIDER band
    WHEN `the Oz band under 50` THEN
        `Oz mother's tables` WITH
            `the table under (א)` IS `the (א) table of annex א' under 50`
            `the table under (ב)` IS `the (ב) table of annex א' under 50`
    WHEN `the Oz band from 50 to 55` THEN
        `Oz mother's tables` WITH
            `the table under (א)` IS `the (א) table of annex א' from 50 to 55`
            `the table under (ב)` IS `the (ב) table of annex א' from 50 to 55`
    WHEN `the Oz band over 55` THEN
        `Oz mother's tables` WITH
            `the table under (א)` IS `the (א) table of annex א' over 55`
            `the table under (ב)` IS `the (ב) table of annex א' over 55`

-- The asterisk under each table: the presence is in hours of 60 minutes
-- (§9(יא)), which changes nothing in the length of a teaching
-- period as the Ministry of Education set it.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1/p3 akn:att_1__hc_1/p5 akn:att_1__hc_1/p7 akn:att_1__hc_1/p9 akn:att_1__hc_1/p11 akn:att_1__hc_1/p13
GIVEN c IS AN `Oz annexed column`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the minutes of presence a column of annex א' asks` c IS
    `the minutes of weekly presence` (`the annexed column's week` c)

`the presence in annex א' changes the length of a teaching period` MEANS FALSE

-- The note under the tables: frontal and role hours that are not whole
-- take the individual and support hours of the column nearest to them, and
-- the position is all the hours over the full position's — the full
-- position of the mother's own table, as F-oz-founding-annex-b-a reads
-- "בסיס המשרה" (common: `what the mother's tables give a mother keeping
-- her week`, `what the mother's tables give a mother cutting her hours`).
-- A mother keeping her week is paid on her position and the annex's step;
-- one cutting her hours works the (ב) table's next column — one frontal
-- hour less — and is paid on its position and the step, her position
-- staying the one she would have had.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1/p14
GIVEN band IS AN `Oz annexed age band` @desc the band the age-reduction rules put her in
      f IS A NUMBER @desc the frontal hours, with homeroom and role hours, of the week she would have had
GIVETH A MAYBE `Oz annexed week`
DECIDE `what annex א' gives a mother keeping her week` band f IS
    `what the mother's tables give a mother keeping her week` (`the mother's tables of annex א' for` band) f

GIVEN band IS AN `Oz annexed age band` @desc the band the age-reduction rules put her in
      f IS A NUMBER @desc the frontal hours, with homeroom and role hours, of the week she would have had
GIVETH A MAYBE `Oz annexed week`
DECIDE `what annex א' gives a mother cutting her hours` band f IS
    `what the mother's tables give a mother cutting her hours` (`the mother's tables of annex א' for` band) f

-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p15 A filing mark; no rule.

§§ `נספח א' -- the checks`

-- Each table opens at the full position (in a (א) table, the position she
-- would have had) and steps down a frontal hour at a time; the annex adds
-- one step in all three bands.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN band YIELD `the annexed table opens at the full position` ((`the mother's tables of annex א' for` band)'s `the table under (א)`) AND `the annexed table opens at the full position` ((`the mother's tables of annex א' for` band)'s `the table under (ב)`)) `the Oz age bands`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN band YIELD `the annexed table steps down an hour a column` ((`the mother's tables of annex א' for` band)'s `the table under (א)`) AND `the annexed table steps down an hour a column` ((`the mother's tables of annex א' for` band)'s `the table under (ב)`)) `the Oz age bands`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN band YIELD `the points the mother's tables add` (`the mother's tables of annex א' for` band) EQUALS `the points the mother's tables add` (`the mother's tables of annex א' for` `the Oz band under 50`)) `the Oz age bands`

-- The tables' arithmetic (F-oz-founding-annex-g-a): each presence is its
-- column's hours, and each position she would have had in a (ב) table is
-- its hours over the table's full position — in every cell but these.
#ASSERT `the cells of the annexed table off its arithmetic` `the (א) table of annex א' under 50` EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `the cells of the annexed table off its arithmetic` `the (ב) table of annex א' under 50` EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `the cells of the annexed table off its arithmetic` `the (א) table of annex א' from 50 to 55` EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `the cells of the annexed table off its arithmetic` `the (ב) table of annex א' from 50 to 55` EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `the cells of the annexed table off its arithmetic` `the (א) table of annex א' over 55` EQUALS LIST
    `the cell of` `the (א) table of annex א' over 55` `the presence row` 3 31,
    `the cell of` `the (א) table of annex א' over 55` `the presence row` 4 29.5
#ASSERT `the cells of the annexed table off its arithmetic` `the (ב) table of annex א' over 55` EQUALS EMPTY

-- The mother's pattern (F-oz-founding-annex-a-a): in each (ב) table the
-- position she is paid on is the one she would have had and the annex's
-- step; each (א) table's column k is its (ב) table's column k+1, with the
-- position she would have had of the (ב) column k, paid on the column's
-- position and the step — in every cell but these.
#ASSERT `the cells of the mother's tables off their pattern` (`the mother's tables of annex א' for` `the Oz band under 50`) EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `the cells of the mother's tables off their pattern` (`the mother's tables of annex א' for` `the Oz band from 50 to 55`) EQUALS LIST
    `the cell of` `the (ב) table of annex א' from 50 to 55` `the position row` 4 (92.53%),
    `the cell of` `the (א) table of annex א' from 50 to 55` `the would-have position row` 2 (96.25%),
    `the cell of` `the (א) table of annex א' from 50 to 55` `the would-have position row` 3 (91.25%),
    `the cell of` `the (א) table of annex א' from 50 to 55` `the position row` 3 (92.53%),
    `the cell of` `the (א) table of annex א' from 50 to 55` `the teaching-support hours row` 4 8.5,
    `the cell of` `the (א) table of annex א' from 50 to 55` `the would-have position row` 4 (87.50%)
#ASSERT `the cells of the mother's tables off their pattern` (`the mother's tables of annex א' for` `the Oz band over 55`) EQUALS EMPTY

-- F-oz-founding-annex-a-a: the mother's tables of all four annexes, held
-- to their pattern, depart from it in 16 cells (pinned in each annex's
-- file): 4 positions she is paid on in a (ב) table, off the step; and in
-- the (א) tables, 8 positions she is paid on, the 3 positions she would
-- have had that annex א's table from 50 to 55 prints as the under-50
-- table's, and that table's 8.5 support hours where its (ב) table prints 8.
-- The encoding reads them by the pattern (convention reading.misprint):
-- `what the mother's tables give a mother keeping her week` and `what the
-- mother's tables give a mother cutting her hours` compute every week and
-- position from the (ב) table and the step.
`the mother's tables of annexes א'–א'3` MEANS
    concat (LIST
        map `the mother's tables of annex א' for` `the Oz age bands`,
        map `the mother's tables of annex א'1 for` `the Oz age bands`,
        map `the mother's tables of annex א'2 for` `the Oz age bands`,
        map `the mother's tables of annex א'3 for` `the Oz age bands`)

`the mother's tables print cells off their pattern` MEANS
    count (concat (map `the cells of the mother's tables off their pattern` `the mother's tables of annexes א'–א'3`)) EQUALS 16
#ASSERT `the mother's tables print cells off their pattern`

§§ `נספח א' -- illustrations`

-- Under 50, keeping a week of 23 frontal hours: 38.5 hours of 40, 96.25%,
-- paid on 103.25%. Cutting her hours from the full week of 24: she works
-- the column of 23, her position stays 100%, and she is paid on 103.25%,
-- as the (א) table's first column prints. The (ב) table's last column has
-- none after it.
#ASSERT `what annex א' gives a mother keeping her week` `the Oz band under 50` 23 EQUALS JUST (`an Oz annexed week of` (`an Oz week of` 23 6 9.5) (96.25%) (103.25%))
#ASSERT `what annex א' gives a mother cutting her hours` `the Oz band under 50` 24 EQUALS JUST (`an Oz annexed week of` (`an Oz week of` 23 6 9.5) (100%) (103.25%))
#ASSERT `what annex א' gives a mother cutting her hours` `the Oz band under 50` 19 EQUALS NOTHING
-- From 50 to 55, keeping a week of 19 frontal hours: 33 hours of 38,
-- 86.84%, paid on 93.84% by the step — where the column prints 92.53%.
-- Cutting her hours from 21: the column of 20, 34.5 hours, paid on 97.79%,
-- her position the 96.05% of 21 — where the (א) table prints 96.25%.
#ASSERT `what annex א' gives a mother keeping her week` `the Oz band from 50 to 55` 19 EQUALS JUST (`an Oz annexed week of` (`an Oz week of` 19 5 9) (86.84%) (93.84%))
#ASSERT `what annex א' gives a mother cutting her hours` `the Oz band from 50 to 55` 21 EQUALS JUST (`an Oz annexed week of` (`an Oz week of` 20 5.5 9) (96.05%) (97.79%))
#ASSERT NOT `the presence in annex א' changes the length of a teaching period`
